// The decision-record heading shape, gated by MD043 required-headings.
//
// This file is loaded by its own hook with an explicit --config, because MD043
// takes one `headings` array and each shape needs a different one. The
// project's general `.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc` MUST NOT mention MD043 at any
// value, including false: it is merged over this file and would silently
// disable the contract.
//
// `?` is the varying title — exactly one heading, where `*` would also admit a
// record with no title. There is no trailing wildcard: the five sections are
// the whole record, so a sixth fails here. `match_case` is not the default:
// without it a record headed `## status` passes a gate whose whole job is the
// shape.
{
  "config": {
    "MD043": {
      "headings": [
        "?",
        "## Context and Problem Statement",
        "## Considered Options",
        "## Decision Outcome",
        "## Consequences",
        "## Status"
      ],
      "match_case": true
    }
  }
}
